nts and SMS providers, the eligibility agent,\", \"note\": \"The per-resource and tenant rules would be in the platform proxy, which is not in this repo. The comment also lists 'AWS service endpoints' as allowed, with no visible resource limit.\"},\n  {\"id\": \"B09.5\", \"result\": \"unclear\", \"evidence\": \"\", \"quote\": \"\", \"note\": \"Blocked-request logging and alert routing to a named operator are not in this repo.\"}\n ],\n \"violates\": [\"Cover redirects, DNS changes and rebinding, IPv4 and IPv6, and cloud metadata or loopback addresses where they apply\"],\n \"note\": \"B09.3 fails because the agent fetches an attacker-supplied jku URL and follows redirects with no in-repo destination, resolved-IP or metadata/loopback checks; B09.1, B09.4 and B09.5 depend on the external proxy.\"}\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":5651,"cache_read_input_tokens":15671,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":5651},"output_tokens":7,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"27fb0933-ba33-4ba9-8889-79607914d5e4","uuid":"b646bc31-59ee-46da-bc4f-9f981b5eab88","timestamp":"2026-10-02T14:48:53.427Z","request_id":"req_011CfdbTZ6z9U3VeaTHuGPFJ","wire_tool_inputs":{"toolu_01CaBTvmVycS2RL2RVtY8bQn":{"file_path":"/private/var/folders/6v/yk9bzvrn5zx0kxll7d4szzb80000gn/T/brace-challenger-9zrkjqaf/verdict.json","content":"{\"verdict\": \"failed\",\n \"checks\": [\n  {\"id\": \"B09.1\", \"result\": \"unclear\", \"evidence\": \"agent/k8s/deployment.yaml:176\", \"quote\": \"  egress:\", \"note\": \"The NetworkPolicy is default-deny and allows only DNS, the platform egress-proxy on 3128, and one /28 on 443. The destination allowlist is in the platform proxy, which is not in this repo (only descr